{
  "semanticId": "control.button",
  "componentType": "UnityEngine.GameObject",
  "description": "按钮组件。点击响应由 RaycastArea 子节点负责。",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "UnityEngine.UI.Image",
      "properties": {
        "type": "Sliced",
        "raycastTarget": false,
        "sprite": "Assets/UI/AtlasResources/CommonPanel/ty_btn_11.png"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "UnityEngine.UI.Button",
      "properties": {}
    }
  ],
  "hierarchy": [
    {
      "nodeName": "RaycastArea",
      "isRequired": true,
      "position": "last-child",
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "LR.RaycastArea",
          "properties": {}
        }
      ],
      "layoutDefaults": {
        "anchorMin": [0, 0],
        "anchorMax": [1, 1],
        "sizeDelta": [0, 0]
      }
    }
  ],
  "postProcess": "button",
  "notes": [
    "Image 的 raycastTarget=false，点击响应由 RaycastArea 负责",
    "Image.type=Sliced 九宫格模式，支持拉伸",
    "默认按钮图片: ty_btn_11.png",
    "postProcess=button 会在配方应用后调用后处理钩子：",
    "  - 根据节点名推断默认 sprite（如 close 按钮用 ty_btn_tk_btn_01.png）",
    "  - 如果没有显式子节点且有 text 属性，自动生成 Text 子节点",
    "  - Button.targetGraphic 绑定到 Image 组件"
  ]
}
